  "prompts": [
    "Build a college football inactive-fan reactivation journey anchored to the major moments of the season.",
    "Create a season-long calendar reactivation journey for inactive NCAA football fans. Backbone touches at kickoff weekend, conference openers, rivalry week, CFP Selection Day, and CFP first-round games. Each fan with a favorite school gets one personalized touch on their school's rivalry-game week.",
    "Need to re-engage college football fans who've gone inactive. Use the season's anchor moments as the backbone, plus an extra personalized rivalry-week touch tied to fan's favorite school."
  ],
  "journey": {
